    thinking: "**Assessing Core Focus**\n\nI\'ve initiated a skills assessment, rapidly discarding irrelevant areas like applet SEO, cloud SQL operations, Figma import, Firebase integration, focus mode, and frontend design. We\'re zeroing in on mouse input specifically, and filtering out other tasks.\n\n\n**Refining Project Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroed in on the core of the 3D space fighter project. I\'ve ruled out Gemini API, GitHub migration, Google Maps, image generation, OAuth integration, planning mode, PWA integration, real-time features, Shadcn UI, and workspace integration. The focus has sharpened to Three.js, specifically flight rotation, camera follow, and input-to-rotation mapping using quaternions and angular velocity. I\'m reviewing `/skills/system_skills/threejs/SKILL.md` alongside STARFALL and NEON ORBIT.\n\n\n"
