    thinking: "**Applying Parallel Edits**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the parallel application of edits to the codebase. Specifically, I\'m working on `/src/scene/GameScene.tsx`. The plan is to pass `(dt, settings)` to `input.consumeSnapshot()` and call `flight.update()` with the updated parameters.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "gjL_ap3fPNOPvdIPrYunUA"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3964069570671958345"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Pass simulation dt and virtual-stick settings into InputManager.consumeSnapshot and remove viewport args from FlightController.update.\", \"EndLine\":213, \"Instruction\":\"Update the phase === \'playing\' input and flight update calls in GameScene.tsx.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"    if (phase === \'playing\') {\\n      const snapshot = input.consumeSnapshot(dt, settings);\\n      const playerAlive = !combat.playerHealth.isDestroyed;\\n\\n      if (playerAlive) {\\n        flight.update(dt, snapshot, settings, telemetry);\\n\\n        if (flight.getBoostJustEngaged()) {\\n          AudioManager.playBoostEngage();\\n        }\\n      }\", \"StartLine\":200, \"TargetContent\":\"    if (phase === \'playing\') {\\n      const snapshot = input.consumeSnapshot();\\n      const playerAlive = !combat.playerHealth.isDestroyed;\\n\\n      if (playerAlive) {\\n        flight.update(dt, snapshot, settings, telemetry, state.size.width, state.size.height);\\n\\n        if (flight.getBoostJustEngaged()) {\\n          AudioManager.playBoostEngage();\\n        }\\n      }\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/scene/GameScene.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating GameScene input and flight tick\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update GameScene.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\205\v\n\202\v\001i\024}\023\362z\375}^\021\215p\231\365w\343\355C8}\330\265\250\223\260\000Q\315\314\f\033\222\fp\207Y\365\016\037\256\260z]\253L\206\335~\277\266\223\340eY\317\326\2001\254\000\202|\037\f\312\303\251\240>\203\217\026\337P\371\234,G\017j-\026\2513\373\343\242\211-\023\253\341\321\t\027\360;\210}>\3016u\236g\310\364Del\234\230:[|\363\210\215\305\327*\032\213\036\177d\354)\242\017c<H\277^\025\022\235\023\032z;\330\aF\322\217\232L\237\024\223\215\315j\262_\r\2756]\336OpL\246f\022,\377\314c\351\300\226\315J\314W\225\017kc\267t\336[v\032+\373\334\333\225tCp\2067\017\365,cq\2021\307\250\227\343p\200\377O\026\315O\325r5\n\310>&\306*m\231\321\224\307~\'\231\372\020\v:-\352\276\331\217\223<\333lc\254\0202\355\252w\f=\214\224s6\316\b\260Zt\330r\245\245\016:\025\242\355\326j.bG\032\303\254\374\033\217\335\242\251\274\360H$\316V\345\240\217`D\237<\221\037\303G\267\322\371\253\"\311W\2202\351~\302\365\032\236bm$=\365\346\232(\034\250\303\354\351\211\244\017\322i7#\201\016\200\275\267\221\311\317\344\254\271\350\346\203SL\252\337\334=\376\024\335\177z\334\362\033\223\261Z\242\350c\356\027\256\367\333\250\321\342\223\271\031\231\315\021GiY\366\275x?\2278#\335\357\253pi`:\336\003*\276\036\306\027\332T\253\022\256\304\255^\254\341\b1\021!\315\253\372\031\271/$\254\331jx\2614KOo\343]\343J\212x\320\263\267\213g\201\230H\277\034\217!\314\253F`7\325\033\035\356\213\272\257\245u\2013\3108k\035\033\302\236\037\255\315\354\002\313\270\344\026\201\3327\234\321M\336\"\205\031\276\347\373\341E\330\370\315\371pK\212t\271\006\035=\025\247#\263\274\371\' \322\032\307T1\241\306c\272-\vQ\326@]k\355\035\030\370\347B-S|\324L\017\333\325\375r\231\264\004J:\227\26351s\237!]Q\027CKP\327]\224fj\025\252`\256\201qc\216p\230\244~\342\214\034\332\320\315\216N6Y\301MN\211\244}{\300\3428\276\036\216dA\330\334\3202\361\037\316}3\355lXn\320}\210\240Y\274\030*\255g\211\231\301\371N\fZ\363.\373u9\362(\t\036\030\034{\006\276wg#\304Q4\322\324\027\254\a\357FB\357[L\aP\