        instruction: "Remove virtual joystick accumulation, curve/deadzone evaluation, and off-nose gimbal; implement direct relative mouse-delta arcade steering with single centralized sensitivity, frame-rate-independent smoothing, controlled max angular velocity, and decoupled 30%x35% visual aim boundary"
        is_edit: true
