    thinking: "**Analyzing Menu Transition**\n\nI\'ve been examining the `SettingsPanel` code, specifically why the `PHASE` variable remained at `\'menu\'`. The `closeLabel` of the back button (which could be \'Back to Menu\' or \'Done\') seems key. Clicking \'Low\' worked, and the labels in `SETTINGS_UI_LABELS` confirm the parameters being adjusted. I\'m focusing on the behavior when clicking the back button.\n\n\n"
